  "content": "<p>Mirana IFC Saigon is envisioned as a contemporary landscape project that harmoniously integrates architecture, greenery, and public spaces. The landscape design focuses on creating a refined and welcoming environment, with carefully planned green areas, pedestrian pathways, and outdoor spaces that enhance the overall experience of the development. Through a balance of natural elements and modern design language, the project aims to create a distinctive landscape identity while promoting comfort, connectivity, and a closer relationship between people and their surroundings.</p>"
